mpared to typical presentation", "Bronchiectasis secondary to recurrent infections: considered but airway dilation on MRI suggests congenital rather than acquired cause", "Congenital immunodeficiency syndrome: possible but not supported by specific immunologic findings in the summary"], "alarm_features": ["Congenital tricuspid stenosis (suggesting systemic disease)", "Persistent failure to thrive pattern (height/weight stasis since birth)"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Cystic Fibrosis / Primary Ciliary Dyskinesia", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.374414976599064, "posterior": 0.374414976599064, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.9, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "etiology", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Congenital Airway Abnormality with Chronic Infection", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.31201248049922, "posterior": 0.31201248049922, "danger": 0.5, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.6, "interrupt_relevance": 0.6, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "anatomy", "representative_diseases": []}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Chronic Rhinosinusitis with Mucosal Abnormalities", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.15600624024961, "posterior": 0.15600624024961, "danger": 0.3, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.0,