ase with Pulmonary Complications: cap polyposis, chronic granulomatous disease, colitis (disease)\n\n[Indirect reasoning chains (PrimeKG 2-hop):]\n  A 10-year-old girl is admitted to the medical floor for a respiratory infection → recurrent upper respiratory tract infections → Cystic Fibrosis / Primary Ciliary Dyskinesia\n  A 10-year-old girl is admitted to the medical floor for a respiratory infection → recurrent sinopulmonary infections → Cystic Fibrosis / Primary Ciliary Dyskinesia\n  A 10-year-old girl is admitted to the medical floor for a respiratory infection → recurrent respiratory infections → Cystic Fibrosis / Primary Ciliary Dyskinesia"}
